      "metrics": [
        {
          "name": "equality-calls",
          "unit": "operations",
          "signal": "operation-count",
          "budget": {
            "max": 20484
          },
          "notes": "Exactly (2k + 1) n - k (k + 1) + 2 = 5n - 4 comparisons, asserted per scale point in crates/similarity-kernels/tests/work_complexity.rs together with a non-increasing marginal-work check; the full oracle needs n^2. No growth bound is declared because the shared linear bound rejects the negative fixed term from the truncated band corners; the budget is 5n + 4 at 4096 elements, matching the single-size scenario."
        }
